# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Teaches: pistons. The socket is up high and the only way up is three lifts, each
# out of step with the last. Roll on when one is down level with you, ride it up,
# roll off at the top. A gulper walks the near side of the last landing: wait for
# the last lift in the far corner, not on the straight line.
name: Piston Steps
time: 70
piston: 4 1.5 0.45
eater: 7,1 9,1 speed 0.8 chase 1.25
route: 2,2 3,2 5,2 6,2 7,2 9,2 10,2 12,2
route: 2,2 3,2 5,2 6,2 7,3 9,3 w3.5 10,3 12,2
grid:
.   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
.   4   4   4|  7   7   7|  A   A   A   A|  D   D   D
.   4S  4   4|  7   7   7|  A   A   A   A|  D   DG  D
.   4   4   4|  7   7   7|  A   A   A   A|  D   D   D
.   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
